{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……左かなぁ","trans":"嗯——……左边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029400010","name":"透","text":"えー、右","trans":"诶——，右边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うーん……左","trans":"嗯——……左边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029400020","name":"透","text":"右だって","trans":"都说了右边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……いや、いいとは思うけど\r\n安すぎると、壊れやすかったりするんじゃないか","trans":"……不，东西是不错\n但太便宜的话，是不是很容易坏啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029400030","name":"透","text":"してるから。貯金","trans":"有在存。存款。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"気合いの入った貯金だなぁ\r\n必要なものなら、そんなケチらなくたって────","trans":"存得还真够拼的啊\n如果是必需品，其实不用那么省────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029400040","name":"透","text":"言ったじゃん。買うから、ネクタイか靴\r\nプロデューサーに","trans":"不是说过了嘛。我会买的，领带或者鞋子\n送给制作人","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────……\r\n……左","trans":"────……\n……左边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029400050","name":"透","text":"右","trans":"右边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……大丈夫だ、透\r\n俺がこれ、プレゼントするから","trans":"……没事的，透\n这个由我来送给你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}